return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:04:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:04:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','The foundation release of the rebuilt Tranzly: a list of your site\'s languages, a language switcher block, and the language API other plugins read.'=>'Ìtújáde ìpìlẹ̀ ti Tranzly tí a tún kọ: àkójọ àwọn èdè ojú-òpó wẹ́bù rẹ, bọ́ọ̀lù al yípadà èdè, àti API èdè tí àwọn afikun míràn ń kà.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Awọn olupese AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Àwọn adáṣe ChatGPT. Olùrànlọ́wọ́ rere gbogbo-nìṣe.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn tí ó dá Claude. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kíkọ̀ àti àṣàrò dáadáa.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati gbowolori kekere.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ile-iṣẹ AI kan ti Ilu Yuroopu pẹlu awọn awoṣe ti o yara, ti ko si gbowolori.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe iye owó kékeré tí wọ́n dára nípa kíkọ àti kóòdù.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtini kan fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ awoṣe tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ̀fà rẹ.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gbogbo gbogbo (a n lo ti nko ba si ohun pataki miran ti a yan)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kikọ ati tun-kikọ','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò gbàyín láàyè láti wọ ojúewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Àwọn ètò wònyí jẹ́ pínpín fún gbogbo plọ́gìnnì tó ń lò wọ́n: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Àwọn kọ́ọ̀fù rẹ̀ wà ní ìpamọ́ nínú ibi ìpamọ́ data ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí, wọ́n sì ń lọ sí ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè tí o yàn nìkan ni — kìí ṣe sí wa rárá.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu bọtọni rẹ wa, nitorina o sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Ko ni idaniloju? Eyikeyi ninu iwọnyi ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Tẹ̀lé e','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Ẹ̀ka Kejì ti Kejì: so %s pọ̀','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Fi adirẹsi iṣẹ ti o ni ibamu pẹlu OpenAI sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Bọtini kan nikan ni a nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun ọkan.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Da bọtọ́n tuntun kan sẹ́dẹ̀ tẹ́ a sì da ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà náà ko.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Ẹ lẹ mọ́lẹ̀ sí ìsàlẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tẹ "Save and test". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn olùpèsè nílò ìdíwọ̀n owó díẹ̀ lórí àkáǹtì náà kí kọ́ọ̀sì kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirẹditi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Adirẹsi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtìnì tí a fi pamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ́ mọ́ títí tí o ó fi fi tuntun rọ́pọ̀ rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Bọtínì (aṣayan)','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ kí o sì dán an wò','Providers'=>'Àwọn Olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipo','Key'=>'Bọtìnnì Ìkọkọ','Get a key'=>'Gba bọtọni kan','Test'=>'Àdánwò','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A ti fipamọ nipasẹ ẹya afikun ti o titun: ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa lẹẹkan si.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Kò ṣe é ṣe láti ṣí kọ́ọ̀sì tí a fi pamọ́ náà mọ́ (àwọn kọ́ọ̀sì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yí padà). Tẹ́ ẹ̀ sí i lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Not connected'=>'Kò tíì sopọ̀','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti sopọ — ìdánwò tó kẹ́yìn yọrí sí rere %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Asopọ — a ko tii dan wo','Which model to use'=>'Irú àwòṣe wo ni lati lo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ jẹ́ àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àtòjọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwòṣe tí kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààràtà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ń gbani nímọ̀ràn fún olùpèsè —','Save models'=>'Ṣe amugbẹ ikojọpọ mọ','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkọ́ṣe àwọn olùpèsè di tuntun','best quality'=>'didẹ julo','lowest cost'=>'idi kekere julọ','fastest'=>'tọ́ jù lọ','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣé kún un fúnra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣé a ṣe àwòṣe kan jáde lónìí? Lẹ́ kọ́ orúkọ rẹ̀ gan-an láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orúkọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi awoṣe kun','Recommended models list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a gbà níyànjú','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A kò lè fọwọ́ sí àkójọ àwọn àwoṣe tí a ṣeduro rẹ̀, nitorina a kò fi àwọn àbá han. Tun fi sọfitiwia afikun (plugin) sori ẹrọ, tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Àtòkọ tí a ń lò ni a tẹ̀ jáde ní %s. Ìgbékalẹ̀ àfikún kọ̀ọ̀kan mú tuntun wá.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìgbàsílẹ̀ tí ó rọ̀run nìkan ni a ń ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́ọ̀dù, kò sí àdírẹ́sì sítì, kò sí ohun kankan nípa àkóónú rẹ̀. Àkọsílẹ̀ náà ní ìwwé-àṣẹ, a sì máa ǹ fojú fò an àkóónú tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ìwé-àṣẹ náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'A yẹ kẹ́yẹ̀ ẹ̀ẹ̀kan kẹ́yẹ̀ %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fipamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo bẹẹni o ba tan','a newer list was installed'=>'A fi àkójọ tuntun kan sori rẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'igba ogun (download) na kuna ayewo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju si i','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yoo wa ni lílò','turned off'=>'tí a pa kuro','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ ojú-ewé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ma binu, o ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣe iyẹn.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Iyẹn kọ́ jọ bọtínì API kan. Ṣe àakọ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si, láìsí àlàfo.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Kọ kọ́kọ́ lẹ bọ́kì sínú bọtìnnì API rẹ.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn àpẹẹrẹ náà.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Fi orúkọ gangan awoṣe náà sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí ìwé ìtọ́nisọ́nà olùpèsè ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A ti fi %s kun. Yan ni abẹ́ "Àwoṣe wo lo yẹ lati lo".','Model removed.'=>'A yọ àwọn àwòṣe kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. Àkójọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plọ́gìn (plugin) náà ni a ń lò.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A túnà kún àwọn àkọsílẹ àwọn àwòṣe náà.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn afikun rẹ lo fipamọ bọtini AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tun tẹ bọtini naa sii ni awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a kò lè ṣí kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI tí o fi pamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yípadà). Tẹ́ ẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nínú àwọn ètò AI náà.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A ti seto AI sílẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀. Fi bọ́tìnnì kún fún olùpèsè AI kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yàn àwọ̀ pátápátá kan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọkan ninu awọn eto AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Olupese AI yẹn ko ni atilẹyin nipasẹ ẹya yii ti afikun naa.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ojula yii ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le de lati ọdọ olupin wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa rẹ ko le de lati inu aaye ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, agbalejo rẹ le n dina awọn asopọ ita, tabi adirẹsi na jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò ní kírédìtì tàbí kótà kankan mọ́. Fi kírédìtì kún un tàbí gbé ìwọ̀n rẹ ga nínú àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ pẹ̀lu wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ. Ó ṣe é kí a ti kọ ọ́ ni àṣìṣe, fagile rẹ̀, tàbí pé àkókò rẹ̀ ti parí. Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́ọ̀sì tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ̀ mọ́ ibi yìí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún bọtínì rẹ. Bọtínì náà le má ní ààyè sí àpẹẹrẹ tàbí àpẹẹrẹ yìí, tàbí kí àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ nílò àrídájú.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Àì sí àwoṣe "%1$s" láti ọ̀dọ̀ %2$s fún bọ́tìni rẹ. Yan àwoṣe miiran nínú ètò AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ ko ni awoṣe "%1$s" ninu. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI, tabi sọ eto rẹ di tuntun pẹlu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s nfi opin si bi o ṣe yara to fun bọtini rẹ lati fi awọn ibeere ranṣẹ. Duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o tun gbiyanju si tun, tabi gbe opin oṣuwọn rẹ soke pẹlu wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s nírírí awọn iṣoro ni akoko yii (aiṣiṣẹ tabi fifuye lori apa wọn). Ko si ohun ti ko tọ si pẹlu awọn eto rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi laipẹ.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kàn sí ìmọ̀ títìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti bọtini ifibọ yii ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju si tun; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju lati ṣẹlẹ, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Àṣàyàn (Tí ó ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Fi bọtínì kan pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí kọ́kọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtini rẹ ṡe iṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ṣe atkojọ awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Fi awoṣe kan kun fun ara rẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s ti fesi ni lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'A ko gba ipa olumulo re laaye lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Bi oludari re lere.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ninu awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ayé yìí ti dé òpin ìwọ̀n oṣooṣù rẹ̀ fún àwọn ìbéèrè AI. Alákòóso kan lè gbé e sókè nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati idiwo','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Akọọlẹ, awọn opin ati awọn aṣẹ ipa wulo fun AI ti a lo nipasẹ: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn owó náà jẹ́ ìṣirò fún ìgbà díẹ̀, tí a ṣe láti ara àwọn owó tí a tẹ̀ jáde; àwọn àwoṣe tíkò ní owó tí a mọ̀ jẹ́ òfìfo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nípa %2$s.','When'=>'Nígbà tí','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Lo fun','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn àmì tó wọlé / tó jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsi','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Àwòn ìbéèrè AI kò tíì sẹlẹ̀ rí.','Done'=>'Ti parọ̀','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ìwọ̀nná owó tó ń ná lọ́dọọdún (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ láìsí ààlà. AI yóò dúró fún ìkùn oṣù náà nígbà tí iye owó náà bá dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìpín àwọn ìbéèrè fún oṣù kan','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo fún àìní opin.','Who may use AI'=>'Ta ni o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Má sàmì kankan láti jẹ́ kí olúkúlùkù tó lè lo àwọn ẹ̀yà ara àfikún náà lo AI. Àwọn alákòóso lè lo o nígbà gbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fipamọ awọn ààrọ̀ ati awọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Awon opin ati awon ase ti wa ni fipamọ.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Awọn ìwé afọwọkọ ti iboju abojuto sonu ninu ẹ̀dà yìí ti fọ́ọ̀mù ìfikún naa. Tun fi sii lati inu àpò ti a ti tu silẹ.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ibùjoko yìí nílò JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Yan ede kan','Upgrade'=>'Ṣe agbéga','Pricing'=>'Iye owo','Start Trial'=>'Bẹrẹ Idanwo','Account'=>'Akawunti','Contact Us'=>'Kanṣoṣo Wa','Affiliation'=>'Ajọṣepọ','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Olùfẹnọ̀kan','greetingHey %s,'=>'Ẹ ǹlẹ %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Gba lati gba awọn ifitonileti imeeli fun aabo & awọn imudojuiwọn ẹya, akoonu eto-ẹkọ, ati awọn ipese lẹẹkọọkan, ati lati pin diẹ ninu awọn alaye ayika WordPress ipilẹ. Eyi yoo ran wa lọwọ lati jẹ ki %s ni ibamu diẹ sii pẹlu aaye rẹ ati dara julọ ni ṣiṣe ohun ti o nilo rẹ fun.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yọ̀ǹda láti gba àwọn ìfitónilétí imeeli fún àwọn àfikún ààbò & ẹ̀yà, àwọn ohun àlùmọ̀ ìkẹ́kọ̀ọ́, àti àwọn ìpèsè ìgbà anfaani, àti láti pín àwọn ìfitónilétí ibi àyíká WordPress ipilẹ̀ kan.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Tí o bá fò èyí sílẹ̀, kò burú! %1$s yóò ṣì máa ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.','Allow & Continue'=>'Gbà & Tẹ̀síwájú','verbSkip'=>'Fò já sí','Skipping, please wait'=>'Fífò sílẹ̀, jọ̀wọ́ dúró','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','Please wait'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ dúró','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ń mú ṣiṣẹ́','This will allow %s to'=>'Èyí yóò jẹ́ kí %s lè','Privacy Policy'=>'Eto Asiri','Terms of Service'=>'Awọn Ofin Iṣẹ','License Agreement'=>'Àdéhùn Ìwé-àṣẹ','Have a license key?'=>'ṢE O NI KỌ́Ọ̀FÙ ÌWÉ ÀṢẸ?','Activate License'=>'Muu iwe-alase ṣiṣẹ','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Wo Alaye Profaili Ipilẹ','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Orúkọ àti ìgbẹ̀yìn orúkọ ti olùlò WordPress rẹ, àti àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì rẹ̀','View Basic Website Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ Aaye Ayelujara','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'URL Ojú-iwe akọkọ & àkọlé, àwọn ẹ̀yà WP & PHP, àti èdè ojú-iwe aaye naa','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ %s','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Àwọn àgbéyẹwò %s & SDK lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, àti bóyá wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí wọ́n ti jẹ́ pípárẹ́','Newsletter'=>'Ìwé ìròyìn','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Àwọn ìfilọ́lẹ̀, àwọn ìkéde, ọjà-ta, kò sí spam','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ayewo','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀yà WordPress & PHP, èdè àti àkọlé ojú òpó wéèbù','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Wo Àkójọ Àwọn Ìfinúgbò & Àwọn Àkòrí','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Àwọn orúkọ, àwọn slug, àwọn ẹ̀dà, àti bóyá wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí wọn kò ní ṣiṣẹ́','optional'=>'a yàn láàyè','Never miss an important update'=>'Máṣe jẹ́ kí ìsọfúnni pàtàkì èyíkéyìí yọ́ ọ́ lọ́wọ́','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'A ti ṣafihan àṣàyàn yìí kí o má baà padanu ìfilọlẹ pàtàkì kankan kí o sì lè ràn wa lọwọ lati jẹ ki %s baamu diẹ sii pẹlu aaye ayelujara rẹ ti o si dara julọ ni ṣiṣe ohun ti o nilo rẹ fun.','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Ẹ ṣe pupọ fun mimu imudojuiwọn wa si %1$s v%2$s!','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Asẹ yẹn kii ṣe ọkan ninu awọn ede aaye yii.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ náà gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni kò gbọ́dọ̀ sọ orúkọ plugin náà.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe koodu ede. Lo agbegbe WordPress kan bi fr_FR tabi de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ o kere ju èdè kan.','That is more languages than one site can list.'=>'Iyẹn jẹ awọn ede to ju ti aaye kan le ṣe atokọ lọ.','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tí a kọ́ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde %s','Tranzly website'=>'Wọ́bìsáìtì Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'oju opo wẹẹbù Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Pro ati iye owó wọn','Languages'=>'Àwọn Èdè','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Èdè àkọkọ ni èdè tí a kọ ohun àkóópọ̀ rẹ sí. Àwọn alábèwò lè yí padà pẹ̀lú bálóòkì ìyípadà èdè.','(default)'=>'(àìṣàtúnṣe)','Locale code'=>'Koodu agbegbe','For example fr_FR'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Oruko (ti ko dandan)','For example Français'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Français','Add language'=>'Fi ede kun','Front-end output'=>'Ìṣajù ojú-òpó wẹ́bù','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàásì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà kò ní fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. 1 sí 8 lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn àfikún Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹbi awọn imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduroṣinṣin nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyí padà lori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon eya beta ni a n se afihan won fun awon fifi sori Pro ti o ni iwe-ase ti o si ni isopọ mo iroyin won. Ni kete ti o ba ni isopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Iroyin.','Save settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò pamọ́','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi ede keji kun labẹ Tranzly ni akojọ aṣayan abojuto, yoo si han nibi.','Switcher'=>'Aṣọ̀yípadà','Accessible label'=>'Àwọn àmì tó ṣeé wọlé','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Aláyípadà èdè','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Awọn ọna aṣopọ si oju-iwe yii ni olukuluku awọn ede aaye naa. Ko ni han ohunkohun titi ti a o fi ṣe akoስተ awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹ lọ.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'Olutiraka','block keywordtranslation'=>'Ìtumọ̀']];